  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "shahar.epilogue.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "最終大会のあと、街の掲示板に見慣れないお知らせが貼られた。「古竜通過日のお知らせ」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「本日午後、上空を古竜が通過します。お手持ちの傘(色は自由)でお迎えください」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "発案は商店街だ。あの限定傘の行列の話が、どこかから広まったよう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "売店には各色の傘が並び、天気予報は「快晴、ただし竜」と出た。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.bkqdo1",
      "speakerName": "シャハル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "定期便は断った身です。祭りに、出て良いものか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "祭りは定期便じゃないです。今日だけの、一回きりです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……つまり?"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.bkqdo1",
      "speakerName": "シャハル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……限定。——参加します。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "午後、専用席の安全帯を締める。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "四百年ぶんの流行研究の集大成という編み紐は、今日は祭り仕様の飾り結びだった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "準備のいい竜だ。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "shahar.epilogue.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "銀白の翼が、青空を割って街の上へ出る。耳が、思わずぴんと立った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "眼下で、一斉に傘が開いた。街全体が、三分間だけ、色とりどりの花畑になる。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.bkqdo1",
      "speakerName": "シャハル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……見てください。三分で終わる景色に、あんなに大勢が、本気だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "あなたの練習の成果ですよ。街のみんなに、うつったんです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼はしばらく黙って、傘の花畑を目に焼きつけていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "四百年もつ記憶に、三分の景色を、丁寧に仕舞う顔だった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.bkqdo1",
      "speakerName": "シャハル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "柿落としの出演届を、出しました。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.bkqdo1",
      "speakerName": "シャハル",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "演目は「古竜通過日——空の祭り、三分間限定」に決めた。……振替便は、ありません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "着地(比喩。実際は屋上に鱗だけ降りる)のあと、髪の銀の留め飾りが夕陽を小さく反射した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.line.012b",
      "lineId": "shahar.epilogue.line.012b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "四百年の人の今週の気分は、今日も私の前髪の横にいる。次の三分限定が、もう楽しみだった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "shahar.epilogue.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
